[[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Working from inside the tailgate, unscrew bolts (1a) securing the outer handle and disconnect tailgate opening linkage (1c), handle side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003197.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>1. Prise out the handle and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003198.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the handle, connect the tail-gate opening linkage and tighten the retaining bolts.</p>"]]